{"id":"5106","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5106_main_cirrocumulus-stratiformis-and-lenticularis-with-irisation_clouds-photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图像显示的是靠近太阳的卷积云上的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">虹彩</span>。虹彩是由云中小而尺寸均匀的超冷水滴引起的光干涉形式，其可显示柔和或珠母色调，尤其是绿色和粉红色。这种显示持续了30分钟。从整体上云显示出较小的元素，其表观宽度小于1°，并且是典型的卷积云波纹。起初，云范围很小，由<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">类似透镜的斑块</span>组成。它迅速扩展到一层<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">成层卷积云</span>，并在10分钟内覆盖了6/8的天空。云高仪记录了稳定的云底位于6400米处。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰赫尔辛基Kamppi","latitude":"纬度: 60° 10' 11'' N","longitude":"经度: 24° 56' 19'' E","date":"30 September 2015 1808 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: S.2.14","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.2.14"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5106_syn_cirrocumulus-stratiformis-and-lenticularis-with-irisation_clouds-photometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>300 hPa图显示了芬兰南部的有一个快速流动的西风（上层极地锋）区域，位于一个阻塞高压以北。反气旋流和干燥气团强烈抑制了云的发展。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© www.wetter3.de","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5106_upper_cirrocumulus-stratiformis-and-lenticularis-with-irisation_clouds-photometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>探测约在前3小时进行，位于图像位置西北方向100公里处。卷积云高度的风速为西北75 kt，温度约为-20°C，虹彩表明存在较小的、尺寸均匀的过冷水滴。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5106_sat_cirrocumulus-stratiformis-and-lenticularis-with-irisation_clouds-photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>NOAA-15同步图像是通道3、4和5的组合，显示在图像的中心有一小簇微小的上部云元素，这是拍摄云照片的位置。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 芬兰气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4809_main_cirrocumulus-lenticularis_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>卷积荚状云云种，出现在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">形状像镜片或杏仁的斑块</span>中。它们通常<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">非常细长</span>，通常具有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">清晰的轮廓</span>。云片大多数是光滑的，整体都是非常白的。这个图像整体显示出明显的波状，使其成为波状云云类。它还显示出在卷积云中有时会看到一些小的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">横向波纹</span>。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Pascual","location":"西班牙瓦伦西亚塞拉","latitude":"纬度: 39° 40' 55'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 27' 35'' W","date":"18 March 2015 1506 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: P.2.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.2.2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5624_main_irisation-iridescence_clouds-photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">晕色</span>覆盖了该云层的大部分。这称之为虹彩。</p>\n<p>该云可确定为非常高的高积云，几乎近似于层积云。鉴于其云层范围相对广大，因此为层状云种。它还<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">薄且透光（透光云类）</span>，并且有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波纹（波状云类）</span>。</p>\n<p>虹彩的产生是由于阳光与大小一致的小云粒相互作用。在与太阳形成约10°的范围内，衍射是虹彩的主要起因。大于10°，光波干涉通常是主要因素。</p>\n<p>颜色以<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">绿色</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">粉色</span>为主，不过也能看到其它颜色，例如<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">蓝色</span>。它们的色调通常柔和、淡雅，但绚丽。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Claudia Hinz","location":"德国，布拉嫩堡","latitude":"纬度: 47° 44' 20'' N","longitude":"经度: 12° 5' 18'' E","date":"31 December 2005 1439 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.13.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.13.3"}]}]}